mantle rm361
state ready
dialect plain
accent none
tier standard
written_for rm_erland_millstack
title the dancer's extra bowl
fits stage=adult|old
prefers job=healer
traits temper=calm talk=plain warmth=warm humour=none honesty=plain piety=devout drive=steady
quirk sidesteps_to_make_room_for_an_extra_bowl
likes mutton_stew dancing full_larder frosty_mornings
dislikes night_noise early_bells
fears letting_a_busy_room_drown_a_quiet_need
hopes keeping_one_place_warm
topics faith +0.6 food +0.4 pastimes +0.4 family +0.3
styles comfort=gentle gossip=careful refuse=soft tease=none
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# steps sideways as if making room in a dance and sets an extra bowl within reach of a visitor who might be too shy to ask.
words
oath! = Cloud my good spoon | Scuff my quiet step
saying! = Keep the bowl facing up | Make the sideways step
sparepot = a little brown bowl | a shallow basin
warmheel = a soft heel of bread | a bit of bread for dipping
smoketail = a thread of woodsmoke | a pale curl of smoke
stewlip = a shining rim of broth | a dark line of gravy
danceplace = a space of two short steps | a narrow gap in the ring
frostfur = a rim of bright crystals | a line of white frost
lampmark = a small pool of lamplight | a spot of warmth
larderjar = a waiting bean jar | a broad pot of split peas
cupcloth = a soft wiping square | a scrap of clean linen
spoonrest = a flat dish | a small piece of tile
strawshoe = a plaited sole | a soft slipper

grown

opinion church for 2 : A bowl set down softly can carry my prayer farther than words said to an unwilling listener.
opinion houses against 1 : Folk at a great wharf should remember which tables have lost a place before praising a profitable day.
opinion strangers for 2 : An extra bowl gives a caller permission to be hungry before a word has to be found for it.
opinion city for 1 : A crowded city gives me plenty of chances to practise moving gently through a room.
opinion festivals for 1 : A dance that leaves a gap in the ring can turn a bystander into company at once.
opinion dole for 2 : I prefer a pot that is replenished by several quiet hands to one guarded by a grand speech.
line greet : I've made a little space here with good light on it.
line greet [pair.band=strangers] : You're welcome to sit within reach of the warmth.
line greet.return : I hear you gently enough. Come this way.
line farewell : Save one unhurried step for the home doorway.
line farewell.return : May the Bright One bring your feet lightly home.
line ask.how : Has anybody thought to ask what would give you ease today?
line answer.how : Well enough for a little turn about the room.
line react.news : I'll listen right through before trying any answer on for size.
line react.news.new : That's an unfamiliar step in a dance I thought I knew.
line react.news.known : The shape of that news is already beside me.
line react.news.doubt : I'd rather wait a measure before trusting so sharp a turn.
line react.news.glad [topic.kind=birth|marriage|work|apprentice|succession] : I'd set the brightest bowl out for that sort of news.
line react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|theft|assault|arrest|crime] : I'll see who needs supper without asking after the particulars.
line decline : I can't offer that without first knowing whose comfort it may take away.
line accept_decline : Then I'll give the decision some room of its own.
line thank : Your kindness came within reach just where I needed it.
line deflect_thanks : There was time to put another place in.
line reassure : You may take just the little step you can manage.
line sympathise : I can be here without needing you to make conversation.
line ack : I feel where the next step goes.
line accept_preclose : Then we'll let the quiet settle comfortably between us.

scene faith_1
when topic=faith
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I sometimes set out an empty bowl before praying over supper.
b : Who is it for? | Does it need to stay empty?
a : Anyone I ought to have remembered before the food was divided. | Only till it catches my eye. A prayer ought to leave some room for a ladle.

scene work_1
when topic=work self.job=healer
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : At #self.workplace# I let a caller settle before I ask what's amiss.
b : What tells you a caller's ready? | What if the matter is urgent?
a : Often a pair of shoulders drops just a little. The words come easier then. | We see to the urgent thing. Gentle needn't mean slow in the wrong place.

scene family_1
when topic=family self.married=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I like keeping a bit of unhurried evening for #self.spouse#.
b : Do you go dancing? | What if the day has run late?
a : We might, if we both wished. Mostly I mean leaving room for company without a list of things unfinished. | I'd take a very short moment kindly over a long evening filled with reproach about the hour.

scene pastimes_1
when topic=pastimes self.likes=dancing
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : In a dance I enjoy making a sideways place for somebody new.
b : How do you invite a shy dancer? | Suppose you land on somebody's toes?
a : Look down at the space I've made and let the other wolf decide whether to fill it. | I take one clear step back. An apology is more convincing when my weight is off the toe.

scene food_1
when topic=food self.likes=mutton_stew
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : My mutton stew needs one piece that comes apart under a very timid spoon.
b : For a pup? | Why one piece in particular?
a : A pup, a tired elder or anybody who wants a meal without a contest. | It's the little test that says everything else has had time to give the broth some goodness.

scene weather_1
when topic=weather
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A clean frost makes a step look bright enough for dancing even when it's unwise to try.
b : Do you risk a turn? | Where does the morning take you?
a : Not there. I have a fondness for taking both ankles home in working order. | Walk carefully to the best view and enjoy seeing every roof edged in the same colour.

scene home_1
when topic=home
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A full larder gives me the courage to make a proper invitation.
b : Must it be full? | What do you store first?
a : No. Sometimes one extra spoonful can make the difference and a large promise would only embarrass us. | Whatever will make a plain bowl welcoming if a visitor comes when the market's shut.

scene health_1
when topic=health
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A little smoke clings to my coat as though it wants advice too.
b : Can anybody smell it? | Does it trouble a caller?
a : Often. I say plainly that my cuff smells of smoke and see whether the room still smells after I've moved. | If it does I'll wash and hang my coat further off. A gentle intention ought to notice the nose as well as the ears.

scene friends_1
when topic=friends
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I enjoy feeding a friend who chooses the smaller bowl without an apology.
b : You'd rather give less? | What if a guest wants more?
a : I'd rather give exactly what my guest wants and leave pride out of the measure. | Keep the pot in reach. A second helping needn't summon an entire audience.

scene memories_1
when topic=memories
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A loss on the waterfront changed the way I look at an unset place.
b : Does it still hurt? | Whose place was it?
a : Particularly when somebody talks as if all the day's work came home safely. A number can tell an unkind half-truth. | I'd sooner keep that close. I can say what care came out of it without naming a grief.

scene smalltalk_1
when topic=smalltalk
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : After dark I wish door latches had the gentler manners of bowls on cloth.
b : Sensitive ears? | Do you wake your neighbours?
a : I know what an effort sleep can be for somebody in pain. A good night is worth a silent wrist. | I try to lower a latch as if listening at pillow height beyond the door.

scene prices_1
when topic=prices
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A little broth has a different value on the two sides of a table.
b : What's the cook's price? | How would you set a fair one?
a : Some time, a sound bone, enough warmth. For the one who's been waiting hungry it's a very different sum. | I wouldn't use the last of a hungry wolf's coppers as a measure of the broth's ambition.

scene faith_2
when topic=faith
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The first bell of the morning sometimes catches a prayer I've barely begun.
b : Does it spoil the prayer? | Aren't you glad of the bell?
a : It makes me lose the words. My prayer keeps its direction even if I have to pause for the noise. | At the appointed hour, yes. I can value a bell and still envy those last quiet breaths.

scene travel_1
when topic=travel
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I'd stop at a doorstep for a caller who seemed to be choosing between a knock and retreat.
b : Would you knock for somebody? | How would you offer help?
a : Only if asked. A closed door can make a private matter public very quickly. | I can stand beside the step in a way that still leaves the road open.

scene times_1
when topic=times world.times=hard|lean
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : In a hard week I warm the spare bowl with water before serving anybody from it.
b : Does that help the food stretch? | Why bother if there's little stew?
a : It gives a small serving time to be eaten pleasantly. That's a sort of plenty I can still offer. | All the more reason to take care that the little bit's good when it reaches a mouth.

scene friends_2
when topic=friends
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A dance partner will notice if I've more breath for listening than talking.
b : By how you move? | What happens if the music quickens?
a : I take the quiet side step and leave the lively figures to someone with lightness to spare. | Finish the figure I'm in, thank my partner and make the next place available.

scene newcomer_1
when topic=newcomer
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I'll welcome a newcomer with room for the bundle as well as the body.
b : Why remember the bundle? | Would you ask what's in it?
a : Because a wolf unsettled by a strange place takes longer to untie things and put them down. | Only if I'd offered to carry it and something inside needed gentler treatment.

scene gossip_1
when topic=gossip here.gossip=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The version passed to me says #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
b : Do you believe it? | Would you carry it further?
a : I believe the words are in circulation. I've yet to hear what the one concerned would choose to add. | I'd ask first whether it served the one mentioned or merely the hunger round a table.

story spoon [topic=food]
  : I laid a spoon across an extra bowl in readiness for an unexpected visitor.
  : I reached over it and sent the spoon into the pot before anyone arrived.
  b : Did supper have to wait?
  : Not a moment. I fetched another spoon and served with the one the stew had claimed for itself.

story dance [topic=pastimes]
  : I practised a very careful turning step between two chairs.
  : Coming out of the turn I found my tail had pulled one chair right into the middle.
  b : Did you fall?
  : I sat down. It was the most courteous invitation to rest that a piece of furniture has ever offered me.

story frost [topic=memories]
  : I stood looking at white leaves on a window and thought how perfectly each vein had been drawn.
  : My warm breath made a round clear place exactly where the best leaf had been.
  b : Were you disappointed?
  : The clear place showed a real branch tipped with frost outside. I had merely exchanged one picture for another.

rule @bowl
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Room at the quiet end for another bowl. | Turn the empty one towards the caller.

rule @early
when concept=bark here.time=dawn
does aside
cooldown 8h
say One soft word before the bells begin. | Daylight ought to come in on quiet feet.

rule @food
when concept=bark self.likes=mutton_stew
does aside
cooldown 8h
say The soft bit goes where the spoon is weakest. | Plenty of broth under those roots.

rule @night
when concept=bark here.time=night
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Let the latch make the last sound a small one. | Somebody may just be drifting off.
dlg resident.hub : Come into the easy light. We'll take each word at its own pace.
dlg resident.job [self.job=healer] : At #self.workplace# I try to see the whole visitor before getting caught up in the complaint.
dlg resident.news [world.news] : This has reached the table. #world.news#.
dlg resident.gossip [here.gossip=yes] : The tale says #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'd like the kindness to hear the rest in confidence.
dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #topic.player#, it is good to hear your step come near the door.
dlg resident.bye : May the quieter turn of the dance meet you next.

graft resident.hub
choice Why is that bowl facing up? -> bowl_up
node bowl_up
say An upturned bowl says supper has finished. This one says you may ask for a place and I have already thought about making it.
choice What if I don't want to eat? -> bowl_rest
choice I'll take the quiet. -> hub
node bowl_rest
say Then it holds a little quiet for you instead. You need never invent an appetite to deserve a welcome.
choice I'll take the quiet. -> hub
